# The dusk-audio/DAF revision every DAF plugin build uses: CI workflows,
# docker/build_release.sh, and the local check in docker/check_daf_checkout.sh
# all read this file, so it is the only place the framework revision is set.
#
# A branch name follows that branch; each run resolves it once, builds that one
# commit on every platform and records it in the job summary and release notes.
# A full 40-character commit SHA holds every build on that commit (e.g. while
# DAF main is broken). Put exactly one value on the first non-comment line.
main
